messages.content:
{
  "acknowledgment": "I’m here to help. We’ll get your mobile data working as well as possible while you’re roaming in France.",
  "thought_process": "Because you’re abroad, the most common causes are: (1) data roaming not enabled on your line or on the phone, (2) hitting your plan’s data limit, (3) restrictive phone settings (Data Saver/VPN/2G mode), or (4) weak/limited local network coverage. I’ll first identify your account to check and enable roaming on your line and verify data usage. In parallel, I’ll guide you through quick on-phone checks to restore the fastest available connection (prefer 4G/5G, ensure roaming/data on, disable limiting features).",
  "what_i_need_from_you": {
    "account_identification": "Please provide the phone number of the line that’s in France (best). If you don’t have that, share your customer ID, or your full name with date of birth (YYYY-MM-DD).",
    "consent": "Do I have your permission to enable international data roaming on your line if it’s currently off? There’s no cost to enable roaming.",
    "confirmation": "Are you physically in France right now and using that SIM/line?"
  },
  "quick_phone_checks_now": {
    "instructions": [
      "Check status bar: Tell me the signal bars (none/1/2/3/4), and the network type shown (5G/4G/3G/2G) and whether an ‘R’/roaming icon appears.",
      "Check network status (on your phone): Confirm that Mobile Data is ON and Data Roaming is ON.",
      "Network mode: Ensure your preferred network mode includes 4G/5G (e.g., 4G/5G preferred). Avoid 2G/3G-only.",
      "Data Saver: If Data Saver is ON, turn it OFF.",
      "VPN: If a VPN is connected, disconnect it temporarily.",
      "Speed test: Run a quick speed test and share the result (rating and Mbps)."
    ],
    "why_this_helps": "These steps rule out common speed killers and make sure your phone can use the fastest available network while roaming."
  },
  "next_backend_actions_after_you_share_phone_number": [
    "Verify your line’s roaming setting and enable it if needed.",
    "Check current cycle data usage vs. your plan limit to see if you’ve hit the cap.",
    "If you’re out of data, we can either refuel up to 2 GB immediately (charged at your plan’s per-GB rate) or discuss a plan change.",
    "Confirm your line is active (not suspended)."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "I can’t change settings on your phone remotely, but I’ll guide you step-by-step.",
    "Roaming speeds depend on local networks; we’ll optimize everything we control to achieve the best (ideally excellent) speed available where you are."
  ]
}

