{
  "message": "Thanks for running those steps. You’ve already fixed the biggest blockers (turned Data + Roaming ON, restored the MMSC URL, Wi‑Fi Calling OFF). Since MMS still won’t send, let’s verify that mobile data is actually working on the phone and rule out common blockers like Data Saver, VPN, and app permissions.",
  "thought_process": [
    "MMS needs working mobile data. Even with signal and the right APN, Data Saver or a VPN can block it.",
    "If your messaging app lacks Storage/SMS permissions, it can’t attach/send MMS.",
    "Network mode should prefer 4G/5G to ensure a reliable data path."
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "title": "Confirm mobile data works right now",
      "do": [
        "With Wi‑Fi OFF, try loading a website in your browser.",
        "Also run run_speed_test() and share the result."
      ],
      "why": "If general mobile data isn’t passing, MMS can’t work."
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "title": "Check for Data Saver restrictions",
      "do": [
        "Run check_data_restriction_status().",
        "If Data Saver is ON, turn it OFF with toggle_data_saver_mode()."
      ],
      "why": "Data Saver can block background data needed by MMS."
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "title": "Rule out VPN interference",
      "do": [
        "Run check_vpn_status().",
        "If a VPN is connected, disconnect with disconnect_vpn()."
      ],
      "why": "Some VPNs block or slow MMS traffic."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "title": "Ensure preferred network mode is modern",
      "do": [
        "Run check_network_mode_preference().",
        "If it is not 4g_5g_preferred (or similar), set it using set_network_mode_preference(mode=\"4g_5g_preferred\")."
      ],
      "why": "Older modes can cause MMS failures; you reported 5G, but we’ll confirm the preference."
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "title": "Verify messaging app permissions",
      "do": [
        "Run check_app_permissions(app_name=\"messaging\").",
        "If Storage and SMS are not granted, grant them with:",
        "grant_app_permission(app_name=\"messaging\", permission=\"storage\")",
        "grant_app_permission(app_name=\"messaging\", permission=\"sms\")"
      ],
      "why": "Without these, the app can’t attach or send MMS."
    },
    {
      "step": 6,
      "title": "Quick radio refresh",
      "do": [
        "Optionally toggle Airplane Mode ON then OFF using toggle_airplane_mode() to refresh the cellular session."
      ],
      "why": "Refreshing radios can clear transient network issues, especially after APN changes."
    },
    {
      "step": 7,
      "title": "Test MMS again",
      "do": [
        "Keep Wi‑Fi OFF for the test.",
        "Run can_send_mms() and try sending a small photo to yourself."
      ],
      "expected": "MMS should send within a minute now that data is available, MMSC is set, and blockers are removed."
    }
  ],
  "data_status": {
    "plan_limit_gb": 15,
    "used_gb": 15.1,
    "refueled_gb": 2,
    "note": "You have active data available now (we added 2 GB), so once phone-side blockers are cleared, MMS should work."
  },
  "request": "Please go through steps 1–7 and share: run_speed_test result, Data Saver status, VPN status, network mode preference, messaging app permissions, and whether can_send_mms() succeeds and a test photo sends."
}

