      "how": [
        "iPhone: Settings > Cellular > SIMs > check status (Active/Missing/Locked).",
        "Android: Settings > About phone > SIM status.",
        "If Missing: power off, remove and reinsert the SIM (reseat), then power on.",
        "If Locked: you’ll need the SIM PIN/PUK; tell me what it shows so I can escalate.",
        "If Active: proceed to the next step."
      ]
