  "thought_process": "MMS requires working cellular data (any speed) plus a correct MMSC in the APN. We’ll first confirm mobile data status and speed, then ensure you’re not on 2G, then verify/reset APN (which fixes most MMS issues). We’ll also rule out Wi‑Fi Calling, Data Saver, and VPN. We’ll test after each change.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "step": "Confirm mobile data works (turn Wi‑Fi off and test)",
      "why": "MMS uses cellular data even when Wi‑Fi is available. If mobile data is off or not working, MMS will stall at “Sending…”.",
      "instructions": [
        "Turn Wi‑Fi OFF temporarily.",
        "On your phone, check network status: check_network_status.",
        "- Share what it shows for: signal strength, network type (5G/4G/3G/2G), and Mobile Data (enabled/disabled).",
        "If Mobile Data is disabled: toggle_data to turn it ON.",
        "Try loading a website in your browser. If it doesn’t load, run run_speed_test and share the result (no connection/very poor/poor/fair/good/excellent)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Ensure you’re not on 2G/3G only",
      "why": "2G is unsuitable for MMS and 3G can be unreliable. Prefer 4G/5G.",
      "instructions": [
        "Check your network mode: check_network_mode_preference.",
        "If it shows 2G or 3G, set it to 4g_5g_preferred using set_network_mode_preference."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Check APN/MMSC settings",
      "why": "A missing/incorrect MMSC is a common cause of MMS failure.",
      "instructions": [
        "Check APN: check_apn_settings and share whether MMSC is set.",
        "If MMSC is missing/incorrect: reset_apn_settings, then reboot_device to apply changes.",
        "After reboot, try sending an MMS again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Rule out Wi‑Fi Calling interactions",
      "why": "Some configurations block MMS over Wi‑Fi Calling.",
      "instructions": [
        "Check: check_wifi_calling_status.",
        "If ON, toggle_wifi_calling OFF and retry sending an MMS (keep Wi‑Fi off during the test)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Disable Data Saver and VPN (if active)",
      "why": "Data Saver or a slow/misconfigured VPN can block or slow MMS.",
      "instructions": [
        "Check: check_data_restriction_status. If Data Saver is ON, toggle_data_saver_mode OFF.",
        "Check: check_vpn_status. If a VPN is connected, disconnect_vpn.",
        "Retry sending an MMS."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Verify messaging app permissions",
      "why": "The app needs storage and SMS permissions to handle media and send messages.",
      "instructions": [
        "Check: check_app_permissions(app_name=\"messaging\").",
        "If storage or sms is not granted, grant_app_permission(app_name=\"messaging\", permission=\"storage\") and grant_app_permission(app_name=\"messaging\", permission=\"sms\").",
        "Retry sending an MMS."
      ]
    }
    ],
