    "From step 1: check_network_status details (signal strength, network type, Mobile Data on/off), whether a website loaded, and speed test result if you ran it.",
    "From step 2: your network mode preference before/after any change.",
    "From step 3: whether MMSC was set; confirm if you reset APN and rebooted.",
    "Whether Wi‑Fi Calling was ON and if turning it OFF helped.",
    "Whether Data Saver or VPN was ON and if turning them OFF helped.",
    "Permissions status for the messaging app."
  ],
  "note": "Please work through steps 1–3 first and share the results. Those usually resolve MMS within minutes. I’ll adjust the next steps based on what you find."
}

