  "message": "Great—mobile data is working, so MMS is being blocked by a setting on the phone side. I’ll walk you through the quickest checks that commonly resolve this, then we’ll reset APN if needed.",
  "why_these_steps": "Wi‑Fi Calling, Data Saver, or a VPN can interfere with MMS even when web browsing works. If those aren’t the cause, an APN reset plus a reboot usually fixes stale MMS settings.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "step": "Turn OFF Wi‑Fi Calling temporarily",
      "android": "Settings > Network & Internet (or Connections) > Wi‑Fi Calling > OFF",
      "iphone": "Settings > Cellular > Wi‑Fi Calling > OFF",
      "then": "Try sending the picture message again (keep Wi‑Fi OFF, Mobile Data ON)."
    },
    {
      "step": "Turn OFF Data Saver / Low Data Mode",
      "android": "Settings > Network & Internet > Data Saver > OFF",
      "iphone": "Settings > Cellular > Cellular Data Options > Low Data Mode > OFF",
      "then": "Try sending the picture message again."
    },
    {
      "step": "Disconnect any VPN",
      "android_and_iphone": "Open your VPN app or Settings > VPN and disconnect.",
      "then": "Try sending the picture message again."
    },
    {
      "step": "If it still fails, reset APN to default and reboot",
      "android": [
        "Settings > Network & Internet > Mobile network > Access Point Names",
        "Menu (⋮) > Reset to default",
        "Then fully reboot the phone"
      ],
      "iphone": [
        "Settings > General > Transfer or Reset > Reset > Reset Network Settings (this resets APN and network settings)",
        "Then fully reboot the phone"
      ],
      "then": "After the reboot, keep Wi‑Fi OFF, confirm Mobile Data is ON, and try sending the MMS again."
    },
    {
      "step": "If it still doesn’t send, check the messaging app permissions",
      "android": "Settings > Apps > [Your messaging app] > Permissions > Allow Storage and SMS",
      "iphone": "Settings > [Your messaging app] > ensure necessary permissions are allowed",
      "then": "Try sending the MMS again."
    }
  ],
  "info_needed": "Are you on Android or iPhone, and which messaging app are you using? This lets me tailor the exact tap-by-tap path.",
  "next_action_request": "Please start with Step 1 (turn off Wi‑Fi Calling), try the MMS, and tell me the result. If it still fails, proceed to Step 2, and so on. Share exactly which step changes the behavior or any error messages you see, and I’ll guide you further."
}

